          "text": "Left ankle and foot tingling and burning"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ongoing medial left ankle/foot tingling and burning by the end of a shift, consistent with the previously described pattern. Some improvement with brace and orthotics, but symptoms still flare when standing at registers for too long. No new weakness or change in baseline paraesthesia pattern."
      }
